\section{How likely is a false positive}

\VAR{n.fap_text} \VAR{n.fpp_text} The estimate weighs a planet, a background eclipsing binary and an eclipsing binary on the target, after \citet{morton2012}, with planet occurrence from \BLOCK{if refs.dressing2015 and refs.fressin2013}\citet{dressing2015} and \citet{fressin2013}\BLOCK{elif refs.dressing2015}\citet{dressing2015}\BLOCK{else}\citet{fressin2013}\BLOCK{endif}. It has no radial-velocity or imaging input.

